  "claim": "The 2014 Academy Award winner Julianne Moore guest starred in \"Emanuelle Goes to Dinosaur Land.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Emanuelle Goes to Dinosaur Land. Sentence: \"Emanuelle Goes to Dinosaur Land\" is the of the fourth season of the American television comedy series \"30 Rock\", and the 79th overall episode of the series.\nPage: Emanuelle Goes to Dinosaur Land. Sentence: Guest stars in this episode include John Anderson, Elizabeth Banks, Jon Hamm, Kristin McGee, Julianne Moore, Michael Sheen, Jason Sudeikis, and Dean Winters.\nPage: Julianne Moore. Sentence: Julianne Moore (born Julie Anne Smith; December 3, 1960) is an American actress, prolific in films since the early 1990s.\nPage: Julianne Moore. Sentence: She is particularly known for her portrayals of emotionally troubled women in both independent and Hollywood films, and has received many accolades, including the 2014 Academy Award for Best Actress.",
