        "original_id": "eec58fe7-2f4b-542b-abad-13743b98a5f3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Emanuelle Goes to Dinosaur Land, 30 Rock\n- People: Julianne Moore, John Anderson, Elizabeth Banks, Jon Hamm, Kristin McGee, Michael Sheen, Jason Sudeikis, Dean Winters\n- Topics: television episodes, guest stars, acting career, awards\n\nFacts:\n- \"Emanuelle Goes to Dinosaur Land\" is an episode of the American television comedy series \"30 Rock\" and is the 79th overall episode of the series.\n- John Anderson, Elizabeth Banks, Jon Hamm, Kristin McGee, Julianne Moore, Michael Sheen, Jason Sudeikis, and Dean Winters guest starred in \"Emanuelle Goes to Dinosaur Land.\"\n- Julianne Moore was born as Julie Anne Smith on December 3, 1960, and she is an American actress.\n- Julianne Moore has been prolific in films since the early 1990s.\n- Julianne Moore is particularly known for portraying emotionally troubled women in independent and Hollywood films.\n- Julianne Moore received many accolades, including the 2014 Academy Award for Best Actress.",
